  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Shaik Rafi vs The State Of Ap on 19 August, 2020 Author: K. Suresh Reddy Bench: K. Suresh Reddy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice K. Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.3247 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This is a Criminal Petition filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure seeking to quash the proceedings in FIR No.7 of 2019, dated 12.01.2019 on the file of Martur Police Station, Prakasam District registered against the petitioners for the offence punishable under Sections 420, 273, 188 r/w 34 of IPC and Sections 59 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (in short \"the FSS Act\").",
    "arguments": "Counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
